  "answer": "2",
  "mistakes": [],
  "hints": [
    "An antiderivative of sin x is −cos x. Evaluate F(π) − F(0)."
  ],
  "solution": [
    "$\\int_0^\\pi \\sin x\\,dx = [-\\cos x]_0^\\pi = -\\cos\\pi + \\cos 0 = 1 + 1 = 2$."
  ],
